    <li><a href="#">Maintenance &amp; Support</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Discover</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Strategic Planning</a></li>
  </ul></div>
  <div class="mfeat">
    <h5>A website that wins you clients.</h5>
    <p>Fixed pricing, SEO built in, launched in weeks — not months.</p>
