          <p>A typical brochure website takes 3&ndash;4 weeks from approved design to launch. E-commerce and custom builds take longer. We give you a clear timeline with your quote &mdash; and we stick to it.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Do you use templates or page builders?</summary>
          <p>No. Every Altus website is hand-coded from scratch. That means faster load times, cleaner SEO, better security and a site that doesn&rsquo;t look like everyone else&rsquo;s.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Can you add AI to my existing website?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Our AI chatbots, receptionists and automation tools can integrate with most existing websites. <a href="contact-us/" style="color:#10B3FE;">Get in touch</a> and we&rsquo;ll assess what&rsquo;s possible.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Do you provide ongoing support?</summary>
          <p>Yes &mdash; we offer maintenance and growth plans covering updates, backups, monitoring and continuous improvement. Launch is the starting line, not the finish.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0A0A12,#1a1a3e);text-align:center;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="reveal" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,54px);color:#fff;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Ready to grow your business<br>with a website that works as hard as you do?</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="font-size:18px;color:#9AA0A6;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 36px;line-height:1.7;">Tell us about your project. We&rsquo;ll respond within one business day with honest advice &mdash; no pushy sales pitch.</p>
      <a href="contact-us/" class="reveal" style="display:inline-block;background:#10B3FE;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;padding:18px 48px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;">Start Your Project <span style="color:#10B3FE;">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .cards4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:54px;}
    .svc-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8ecf1;border-radius:20px;padding:36px;transition:all .3s ease;display:block;}
    .svc-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(16,179,254,.15);border-color:#10B3FE;}
    .svc-card h3{font-size:22px;margin:18px 0 12px;}
    .svc-card p{color:#5a5a6e;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;}
    .svc-icon{line-height:1;display:inline-block;}
    .svc-link{color:#10B3FE;font-weight:700;}
    .step-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8ecf1;border-radius:20px;padding:32px;}
    .step-num{width:48px;height:48px;background:#10B3FE;color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;}
    .step-card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:10px;}
    .step-card p{color:#5a5a6e;line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;}
    .ind-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;transition:all .3s ease;display:block;color:#fff;}
    .ind-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:#10B3FE;background:rgba(16,179,254,.08);}
    .ind-card h3{font-size:20px;margin:16px 0 10px;color:#0A0A12;}
    .ind-card p{color:#9AA0A6;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:14px;}
    .tool-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8ecf1;border-radius:20px;padding:36px;transition:all .3s ease;display:block;}
    .tool-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(16,179,254,.12);border-color:#10B3FE;}
    .tool-card h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;}
    .tool-card p{color:#5a5a6e;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;}
    .faq-list details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8ecf1;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;}
    .faq-list summary{padding:20px 24px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;}
    .faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
    .faq-list summary::after{content:'+';float:right;color:#10B3FE;font-size:22px;}
    .faq-list details[open] summary::after{content:'\2212';}
    .faq-list details p{padding:0 24px 22px;color:#5a5a6e;line-height:1.7;}
    @media(max-width:900px){.cards3{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}.cards4{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}.tools-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}}
    @media(max-width:1200px) and (min-width:901px){.cards4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr) !important;}.why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}}
  </style>

<script>
  // ---- cinematic intro: logo -> background -> hero ----
  (function(){
    var intro = document.getElementById('intro');
    var src = document.querySelector('#dlHeader .dl-logo img');
    if(src){
      var c = src.cloneNode();
      c.removeAttribute('style');
      document.getElementById('introLogo').appendChild(c);
    }
    var done = false;
    function finish(){
      if(done) return; done = true;
      intro.classList.add('bye');
      setTimeout(function(){ intro.style.display = 'none'; }, 1150);
    }
    setTimeout(finish, 1500);          // logo moment, then wipe up to reveal bg
    setTimeout(finish, 4500);          // hard safety
    intro.addEventListener('click', finish); // click to skip
  })();

  // marquee content (industry words, no invented client claims)
  var words = ['SCHOOLS','HEALTHCARE','REAL ESTATE','E-COMMERCE','FINTECH','TRADES','HOSPITALITY','PROFESSIONAL SERVICES'];
  var track = document.getElementById('mtrack'), html = '';
  for(var r=0;r<2;r++){ words.forEach(function(w,i){ html += '<span>'+w+(i%3===0?' <b>●</b>':'')+'</span>'; }); }
  track.innerHTML = html + html;

  // header morph on scroll
  var header = document.getElementById('dlHeader'), toTop = document.getElementById('toTop');
  function onScroll(){
    var y = window.scrollY || window.pageYOffset;
    header.classList.toggle('scrolled', y > 90);
    var navLogo = document.getElementById('navLogo');
    if (navLogo) {
      navLogo.src = y > 90 ? navLogo.getAttribute('data-logo-dark') : navLogo.getAttribute('data-logo-white');
    }
    toTop.classList.toggle('show', y > 600);
    closePanels();
  }
  window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, {passive:true});

  // mega + dropdown panels (desktop)
  var megas = {megaAi:document.getElementById('megaAi'),megaWeb:document.getElementById('megaWeb')};
  var drops = {dropInd:document.getElementById('dropInd'),dropRes:document.getElementById('dropRes')};
  function closePanels(){
    Object.keys(megas).forEach(function(k){megas[k].classList.remove('show')});
    Object.keys(drops).forEach(function(k){drops[k].classList.remove('show')});
  }
  document.querySelectorAll('.dl-nav > li').forEach(function(li){
    var mk = li.getAttribute('data-mega'), dp = li.getAttribute('data-drop');
    li.addEventListener('mouseenter', function(){
      closePanels();
      if(mk){ megas[mk].classList.add('show'); }
      if(dp){
        var p = drops[dp], r = li.getBoundingClientRect();
        p.style.left = Math.max(24, r.left - 40) + 'px';
        p.classList.add('show');
      }
    });
    li.addEventListener('mouseleave', function(){ var t=setTimeout(closePanels,280); li.addEventListener('mouseenter', function c(){clearTimeout(t); li.removeEventListener('mouseenter',c);}); });
  });
  Object.keys(megas).forEach(function(k){
    megas[k].addEventListener('mouseenter', function(){ megas[k].classList.add('show'); });
    megas[k].addEventListener('mouseleave', function(){ setTimeout(function(){ if(!document.querySelector('.dl-nav > li:hover')) closePanels(); },280); });
  });

  // mobile menu
  var burger = document.getElementById('burger'), mmenu = document.getElementById('mmenu');
  burger.addEventListener('click', function(){ mmenu.classList.add('open'); mmenu.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); document.body.style.overflow='hidden'; });
  document.getElementById('mmClose').addEventListener('click', function(){ mmenu.classList.remove('open'); document.body.style.overflow=''; });
  document.querySelectorAll('.mm-acc').forEach(function(btn){
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var sub = btn.nextElementSibling, open = btn.classList.toggle('open');
      sub.style.maxHeight = open ? sub.scrollHeight + 'px' : '0px';
    });
  });
  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape'){ mmenu.classList.remove('open'); document.body.style.overflow=''; closePanels(); } });

  // scroll reveals
  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(es){
    es.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
  }, {threshold:.12});
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function(el){ io.observe(el); });

  toTop.addEventListener('click', function(){ window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'}); });
</script>
</body>
</html>
